COMP 2404 A/B - Assignment #3
Author:  Antony Punnassey 101336946

Purpose:

  Manages the text messages and subscribers of a telephone company (telco).
  print all messages, all subscribers with their messages,
  subscribers in descending order of message activity, and compute the
  most frequent sending and receiving subscribers (Assignment #2 included as menu 4 and 5).

Source files:
  main.cc Control.cc View.cc Telco.cc SubArray.cc MsgList.cc Msg.cc
  ExternMsg.cc InternMsg.cc Subscriber.cc Date.cc Time.cc
Header files:
  defs.h Control.h View.h Telco.h SubArray.h MsgList.h Msg.h ExternMsg.h
  InternMsg.h Subscriber.h Date.h Time.h
Other files:
  Makefile README
Data files: none

Compiling:
  make

Launching (no command line arguments):
  ./a3

Cleaning:
  make clean
